 "director": {
  "mode": "hand",
  "notes": "Hypocrites (13-16). The gloss on «السفهاء» is placed on Allah's reply (13:16), never on their insult (13:12). Allah's «يستهزئ» is explained as recompense (Al-Muyassar). The devils (14) are never drawn. The coins undraw at «تجارتهم»: the trade brought no profit. STAGING v4: 13: the believers call the hypocrites to believe, they answer and turn away; the believers (the Companions) are shown on «الناس». 14-15: the hypocrites walk to the believers and speak, then walk off to their leaders (both tafsirs: شياطينهم = رؤساؤهم/زعماؤهم, drawn as an uncountable group of disbelievers) and speak again; nothing on the Name (15:1). 16: the losing trade in a market, the coins undraw on «تجارتهم»."
 },
